{"id": "msg_ebf61b3b05824a4a8efadf7b8e4b310e", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "禅道回写已**提交落库**，摘要如下。\n\n## 禅道 #6306（已关闭链上状态）\n\n| 项 | 值 |\n|----|-----|\n| **zt_bug** | `status=resolved`，`resolution=fixed`，`resolvedBy=tiany`，`resolvedDate=2026-11-06 18:05:33`，`assignedTo=zhunan` |\n| **zt_action** | `id=88656`，`action=resolved`，含根因/修复/提交号备注 |\n\n说明：第一次开事务时只 `close_session` 未 `commit`，变更被回滚，库上仍是 **active**；已用新会话 **begin → update/insert → commit → close** 再写一次，当前与上表一致。\n\n## 代码与 Git（此前已推送）\n\n- **zhi2-web-admin** `develop/v3.0.0`：合并修复，远端约 **`d9c2be7aa`**\n- **苏州市房地产监测V3** 父仓：**`497ec55`** 更新子模块指针\n- **改动要点**：[AnnexUpload `getList`](<zhi2-web-admin/src/components/AnnexUpload/index.vue>) 签名变化时 `finally` 链式再拉；[AppendixPackageSection `validateRequired`](<zhi2-web-admin/src/components/AppendixPackageSection/index.vue>) 有 `prefillContext` 时先幂等 `applyPrefillToUpload`\n\n## 请你本地再确认\n\n在客测部署 **`develop/v3.0.0`（含上述提交）** 后，按原路径复测：**现售备案申请 → 营业执照已带出 → 直接保存** 应不再误报必填。\n\n禅道页面：[bug 6306](http://zentao-biz.zhi.com/index.php?m=bug&f=view&bugID=6306)。"}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T10:05:58.375Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
